    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wuda na Edomu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao nyuma ya agho, Wamoabu, na Waamoni, na wandu wamu wa Wamueni, wikacha kubonya wuda na Jehoshafati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wandu wamu wikacha wikamzera Jehoshafati, “Jeko izungu ibaa ja wandu wawuyacha kufuma Edomu wichelwa nakumoni, wafuma bahari nakimonu; nawo hawaja wangia Hazazoni-tamari” (niyo En-gedi). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko Jehoshafati ukangilwa ni wowa, ukawoka kumlola BWANA; ukaeresha malagho wandu wifunge tumu andu kose isangenyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wandu wa Juda wikakwanyika kulola wutesia kufuma kwa BWANA; wikacha kufuma mizi yose ya Juda kumlola BWANA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko Jehoshafati ukawuka ikwanyikonyi ja wandu wa Juda na Jerusalemu andenyi ya Hekalu ya BWANA imbiri ya waza mbishi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ukaghamba, “Ee BWANA, Mlungu wa weke aba, wele oho si Mlungu kuko mlungunyi? Si oho kubonyeragha nguma mawuzuri gha mbari rose ra wandu? Oho kwawadie ndighi na kudima, hata ndekuwadie ungi udimagha kusimana nakumoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Si oho kumoni ee Mlungu odu korewiwingieghe wandu werekoghe wikikaia andenyi ya iji isanga imbiri ya wandu wako Israeli, kukajineka kivalwa cha mghenyi wako Abrahamu kwa kala na kala?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.41.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa. 41.8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JAS.2.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jak. 2.23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wamerie kukaia andenyi yaro; wikakuaghia Hekalu ekuneka ishima wikighamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Kiwiwi chingi chikadichea, wuda, angu wukongo, angu saka izamie, angu njala, dichakaia kimusi imbiri kwako andenyi ya Hekalu ihi ekutasira, nesi dichakulilia kwa wundu ghwa makorongo ghedu, na oho kuchasikira na kudikira.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Idana wona wandu wa Amoni, na Moabu na Edomu, wamerie kufuma kulwa nesi. Iji weke aba werefumieghe Misri korewighirieghe wisengie agho masanga. Wandu wedu wikasikira, hata ndewerewitoteshereghe anduangi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.2.4+DEU.2.5+DEU.2.6+DEU.2.7+DEU.2.8+DEU.2.9+DEU.2.10+DEU.2.11+DEU.2.12+DEU.2.13+DEU.2.14+DEU.2.15+DEU.2.16+DEU.2.17+DEU.2.18+DEU.2.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wuk. 2.4-19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wona seji widilipagha! Wawuyacha kudiwinga difume iji isanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Witanye Mlungu odu, angu isi ndediwadie ndighi relwa na ijo izungu ibaa ja wandu wichagha kulwa nesi. Ndediwadie jingi jebonya, ela daawuyakusuwiria oho.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wandu wose wa Juda werekaieghe kimusi imbiri ya BWANA chiaimweri na waka wawo na wana wawo aho Hekalunyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Roho wa BWANA ukamseria Jahazieli mwana wa Zekaria wawae Benaia wa Jeieli mwana wa Matania, Mlawi wa kivalwa cha Asafu, ukikaia aghadi ya ikwanyiko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukaghamba, “Sikirenyi inyo mmbose wandu wa Juda, nenyo mkaiagha Jerusalemu, na Mzuri Jehoshafati: BWANA wamzera kukaia msekambo ni chongo hata kujiobua ijo izungu ibaa ja wandu, angu wuda si ghonyu ghungi ela ni ghwa Mlungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.20.1+DEU.20.2+DEU.20.3+DEU.20.4+DEU.20.5+DEU.20.6+DEU.20.7+DEU.20.8+DEU.20.9+DEU.20.10+DEU.20.11+DEU.20.12+DEU.20.13+DEU.20.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wuk. 20.1-14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wiserienyi kesho; ola wiajokeria na Mshoromoto ghwa Sisi, nenyo mchawikua kutuonyi kwa vololo, mashariki ya kireti cha Jerueli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyo ndemchaalwa ughu wuda; wadenyi wulalo ghonyu, nenyo mchawona seji BWANA umnekagha wusimi ee wandu wa Juda na Jerusalemu. Msekambo ni chongo; wifumienyi kesho, na BWANA uchakaia andwamweri nenyo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.14.13+EXO.14.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuf. 14.13-14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko Jehoshafati ukaghoghomesha chongo chake wushu ghwake ghukadunga andonyi, na wandu wose wa Juda na awo wikaiagha Jerusalemu wikaghwa andonyi imbiri ya BWANA, wikamtasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walawi wa kivalwa cha Kohathi na cha Kora wikawuka kimusi kumkasa BWANA, Mlungu wa Israeli kwa lwaka lubaa na ndighi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wikawuka nakesho kio, wikaghenda cha kireti cha Tekoa; hata iji werekoghe wikighenda, Jehoshafati ukawuka kimusi ukaghamba, “Nisikirenyi inyo wandu wa Juda nenyo mkaiagha Jerusalemu! Mrumirienyi BWANA Mlungu onyu nenyo mchamangishwa; wirumirienyi walodi wake, nenyo mchasima.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wendameria kubonya njama na wandu, ukawika wandu wem'boria BWANA na kumkasa wirwae nguwo ra wueli; wikakiria naimbiri ya ijeshi wikighamba,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
